#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "29 May 2026 {#29-may-2026}"
msgstr "29 Mayo 2026 {#29-may-2026}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Qiskit Code Assistant service discontinued** - The preview service has been discontinued and the Visual Studio Code and JupyterLab extensions have been archived.\n"
msgstr "**Itinigil na ang Qiskit Code Assistant service** - Itinigil na ang preview service at na-archive na ang mga extension para sa Visual Studio Code at JupyterLab.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  Based on feedback and usage patterns, more users are running Qiskit Code Assistant models locally and working in editor integrations that are already part of their development workflow.\n"
msgstr "  Batay sa feedback at mga usage pattern, mas maraming users ang nagpapatakbo ng mga Qiskit Code Assistant model nang lokal at gumagawa sa mga editor integration na bahagi na ng kanilang development workflow.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  Qiskit Code Assistant models remain available for local use. See the [Qiskit Code Assistant](/guides/qiskit-code-assistant) documentation for more information.\n"
msgstr "  Available pa rin ang mga Qiskit Code Assistant model para sa lokal na paggamit. Tingnan ang dokumentasyon ng [Qiskit Code Assistant](/guides/qiskit-code-assistant) para sa karagdagang impormasyon.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Previous updates {#previous-updates}"
msgstr "Mga naunang update {#previous-updates}"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "28 October 2025 {#28-october-2025}"
msgstr "28 Oktubre 2025 {#28-october-2025}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "We have updated the model available in the service to the newer `mistral-small-3.2-24b-qiskit` model\n"
msgstr "Na-update namin ang modelong available sa serbisyo sa mas bagong `mistral-small-3.2-24b-qiskit` model\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "We have open-sourced two new models for local inference in Hugging Face:\n"
msgstr "Nag-open-source kami ng dalawang bagong model para sa local inference sa Hugging Face:\n"

